    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "\"Heat as a push factor? Examining the relationship between urban heat island and residential mobility in San Antonio, USA\" evaluated the connection between urban heat island exposure and inter-annual household moves using geocoded address records and Landsat land surface temperature data. \"Metropolis-scale resilient and trustworthy traffic flow inference using multi-source data\" introduced a Task-Aware Attentive Neural Process to predict traffic flows and quantify both aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty by fusing floating car data with sparse detector records. \"Analysing influence of retail accessibility and spatial organisation of in store retail on cross channel shopping behaviour in tier II Indian cities\" used GIS road-network analysis and survey data to evaluate how network distance to physical stores shapes cross-channel shopping habits in a planned Tier-II Indian city.",
